{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Explicitly migrate selected source patch journals into instance-local runtime records using the same verified lazy-conversion path as journal writes. Select one/all libraries and controls; limit caps journals actually migrated (0 unlimited); dry_run enumerates legacy journals and byte counts without writes. Per-control migration is idempotent, compares every migrated entry, then removes the legacy record through app.delete. Returns per-journal results and converted/candidate/skipped/failed counts. Does not change source facets, memory entries, plan state, or history API responses.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;","params":[{"desc":"One source library, or empty/* for every library with a controls index","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"One control name/id, or empty/* for every control in the selected libraries","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"Stop after this many migrated journals; 0 means no limit","name":"limit","type":"Integer"},{"desc":"Report candidate journals without creating or deleting records","name":"dry_run","type":"Boolean"},{"desc":"Calling session, used to authorize removal of verified legacy journals","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"wtturu1a1c1872c7av89","readers":[],"time":1794248603477,"username":"system","writers":[]}